## 🚀 Quick Start

### Prerequisites

```bash
# Required tools
terraform >= 1.6.0
kubectl >= 1.29.0
helm >= 3.12.0
ansible >= 2.15.0
pre-commit >= 3.5.0

# Install development dependencies
make install-dev-tools

# Install pre-commit hooks
pre-commit install
```

### Your First Contribution

```bash
# 1. Create feature branch
git checkout -b feature/new-karpenter-nodepool

# 2. Make changes
vim terraform/modules/karpenter/nodepool-batch.yaml

# 3. Run local validation
make validate
make test

# 4. Commit with conventional commits
git commit -m "feat(karpenter): add batch processing nodepool"

# 5. Push and open PR
git push origin feature/new-karpenter-nodepool
```

