## 🔄 Development Workflow

### Branch Strategy

```
main
  ├── develop (integration branch)
  │   ├── feature/eks-upgrade-1.30
  │   ├── feature/gpu-factory-phase1
  │   └── fix/karpenter-consolidation-bug
  └── hotfix/security-patch-cve-2024-xxxx
```

**Branch Naming Convention**:
- `feature/` - New features or enhancements
- `fix/` - Bug fixes
- `hotfix/` - Urgent production fixes
- `refactor/` - Code refactoring
- `docs/` - Documentation updates

### Commit Message Format

Follow [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/):

```
<type>(<scope>): <subject>

[optional body]

[optional footer]
```

**Types**:
- `feat` - New feature
- `fix` - Bug fix
- `docs` - Documentation
- `refactor` - Code refactoring
- `test` - Adding tests
- `chore` - Maintenance tasks

**Examples**:

✅ Good:
```
feat(karpenter): add GPU nodepool for ML workloads

- Implements g4dn and p3 instance families
- Adds NVIDIA driver installation
- Updates documentation with GPU scheduling guide

Closes #123
```

✅ Good:
```
fix(eks): resolve IRSA role assumption timeout

Increases timeout from 30s to 60s for large clusters.
Tested in nonprod-use1 cluster.

Fixes #456
```

❌ Bad:
```
updated karpenter stuff
```

