## 🧪 Testing Requirements

### Terraform Testing

```bash
# 1. Format check
terraform fmt -check -recursive

# 2. Validate syntax
terraform validate

# 3. Security scan
tfsec .

# 4. Cost estimation
infracost breakdown --path .

# 5. Plan (no apply)
terraform plan -out=tfplan
```

**Required before PR approval**:
- [ ] `terraform fmt` passes
- [ ] `terraform validate` passes
- [ ] `tfsec` scan has zero HIGH/CRITICAL findings
- [ ] Cost impact documented (if >$100/month change)

### Ansible Testing

```bash
# 1. Syntax check
ansible-playbook playbooks/eks-node-hardening.yml --syntax-check

# 2. Lint with ansible-lint
ansible-lint playbooks/

# 3. Molecule test (if role has tests)
cd roles/cis-hardening
molecule test

# 4. Dry-run against nonprod
ansible-playbook playbooks/eks-node-hardening.yml --check --diff
```

**Required before PR approval**:
- [ ] `ansible-lint` passes
- [ ] Molecule tests pass (if applicable)
- [ ] Dry-run successful in nonprod environment

### Kubernetes Manifest Testing

```bash
# 1. YAML validation
yamllint kyverno-policies/

# 2. Dry-run apply
kubectl apply -f kyverno-policies/ --dry-run=server

# 3. Policy validation (Kyverno)
kubectl apply -f test-pod.yaml --dry-run=server

# 4. Security scan
kubesec scan deployment.yaml
```

