## 🛠️ Troubleshooting

### Common Issues

#### Terraform State Lock

```bash
# Error: "Error acquiring the state lock"
# Solution: Force unlock (use with caution)
terraform force-unlock <LOCK_ID>

# Prevention: Always use CI/CD pipeline for applies
```

#### Ansible SSH Connection Failures

```bash
# Error: "Failed to connect to the host via ssh"
# Debug:
ansible all -i inventory/aws_ec2.yml -m ping -vvv

# Common fixes:
# 1. Check security group allows SSH from runner IP
# 2. Verify IAM instance profile has SSM permissions
# 3. Use SSM Session Manager instead:
ansible_connection: aws_ssm
```

#### Kubernetes Apply Failures

```bash
# Error: "The connection to the server was refused"
# Solution: Update kubeconfig
aws eks update-kubeconfig --name prod-core-use1 --region us-east-1

# Verify connection
kubectl cluster-info
```

